<section class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden px-6 bg-secondary">
  
  <!-- Outer Angled Section Shape Background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary via-primary to-secondary pointer-events-none"></div>
  
  <!-- Subtle Glowing Accent Ring -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-accent/5 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-sm border border-accent/20 bg-primary/60 backdrop-blur-md p-10 sm:p-16 relative z-10 text-center space-y-8 shadow-2xl">
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <span class="font-sans text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-accent block">Garantía de Excelencia</span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 tracking-wide max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-tight">
        ¿Enfrenta un Desafío Legal Complejo? <br />
        <span class="text-accent">Permita Que Diseñemos Su Estrategia</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-[2px] bg-accent mx-auto mt-4"></div>
    </div>
    
    <p class="font-sans text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
      Nuestros socios fundadores revisarán personalmente los antecedentes de su caso de forma estrictamente confidencial. Agende hoy una sesión ejecutiva preliminar presencial o remota.
    </p>
    
    <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#contacto" class="gold-gradient-btn px-10 py-4 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold rounded-xs w-full sm:w-auto text-center">
        Agendar Consulta Legal
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/1234567890" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-8 py-4 border border-slate-700 hover:border-accent hover:text-accent text-slate-200 transition-all duration-300 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold rounded-xs w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-secondary/40 backdrop-blur-xs flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
